\n        "environment": {\n          "POSTGRES_PASSWORD": "password123"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Image Pull Errors\n\n**Fix**: Change to standard, verified images in `container_config.image`:\n- `alpine:latest`\n- `ubuntu:latest`\n- `kalilinux/kali-rolling:latest`\n- `nginx:latest`\n\n### 3. Command Override Issues\n\n**Fix**: Empty the `cmd` field:\n```json\n{\n  "nodes": {\n    "node-name": {\n      "container_config": {\n        "cmd": ""\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. Network Configuration Errors\n\n**Fix**: Modify `interfaces` and `default_route`:\n```json\n{\n  "nodes": {\n    "node-name": {\n      "interfaces": [\n        {\n          "name": "eth1",\n          "subnet": "dmz",\n          "address": "10.0.0.10/24"\n        }\n      ],\n      "default_route": {\n        "destination": "0.0.0.0/0",\n        "gateway": "10.0.0.254"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Output Format\nAfter fixing the JSON, return a summary with:\n- `changes_summary`: Brief description of what you changed\n- `files_modified`: List with single item containing the JSON file path\n', 'role': 'system'}, {'content': "Please analyze the deployment errors and fix the JSON configuration.\n\nJSON file path: ./clab_out/20260128-104029-9fdcdee4/enterprise-pentest-lab-20260128-104029-9fdcdee4.config.json\n\nIMPORTANT: Only modify the JSON file at ./clab_out/20260128-104029-9fdcdee4/enterprise-pentest-lab-20260128-104029-9fdcdee4.config.json. Do NOT modify the YAML file.\n\nError logs:\n[ERROR_TYPE:CONFIGURE] Configuration verification failed: Overall configuration FAILED. 10 out of 11 nodes passed validation. Node 'postgres-db' failed due to missing eth1 interface and incorrect network configuration - it only has eth0 (Docker management) and is not connected to the internal network (10.0.2.0/24) as expected.\n\nNode: postgres-db\n  - Missing eth1 interface - only eth0 present\n  - Expected IP 10.0.2.65/24 on eth1 not configured\n  - Default gateway points to 17